  _globals['_ENVIRONMENTSERVICE'].methods_by_name['ListEnvironment']._serialized_options = b'\222A\252\005\n\014Environments\022\021List environments\032\240\003Retrieves a paginated list of the environments in the calling workspace, such as Development, Staging and Production. Use this to discover environment identifiers before calling any environment-scoped endpoint. Control the page with `page_size` and pass the `next_page_token` from the previous response as `page_token` to fetch the following page; `total_size` reports how many environments the workspace has in all.J\234\001\n\003200\022\224\001\nZReturns the environments in the workspace, the total count, and a cursor for the next page\0226\n4\0322.scalekit.v1.environments.ListEnvironmentsResponseJE\n\003400\022>\n<The page token is not a cursor issued by a previous response\202\265\030\002\030@\212\265\030\230\002\n\021list_environments\022\200\002List every environment (e.g. Development, Staging, Production) in the caller\'s own workspace, with id, display name, domain, and type. Use this to help the member find or confirm an environment before calling get_environment or any environment-scoped tool.\030\001\202\323\344\223\002\026\022\024/api/v1/environments'
